# Agent team (Curvenote)

For non-trivial work in **Multitask Mode**, use the three-agent workflow defined in `.cursor/skills/agent-team/SKILL.md`:

| Phase | Subagent | Model |
|-------|----------|-------|
| Plan | `architect` | Claude Opus 4.8 |
| Implement | `coder` | Composer 2 |
| Review | `reviewer` | GPT 5.5 |

Subagent prompts live in `.cursor/agents/`. Parent agent orchestrates; subagents do not share conversation context — pass full task text inline.

Skip the team for trivial single-file fixes. Triage before dispatching.
